---
description: Prepare one assessOverlap evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CivicProposal[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Compare proposals by intended benefit, location, and required work. Identify genuine duplicates and complementary bundles without merging projects whose similar wording masks different communities or uses; obtain proposer review for material combinations. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
